<p>For each turn you spend stamina, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.7%, 1.3%, 1.8%, 2.2%, 2.5%</acronym> resist all and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.1%, 0.3%, 0.4%, 0.5%, 0.6%</acronym> all resistances cap for 3 turns. The buff stacks up to 5 times, and each new application refreshes the duration.</p><p>Additionally, at talent level 5 and above, Breathing Room and Dauntless Challenger are 19% more effective.</p>